      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "Project data + scoping\nGuide-me function history\nStructured agent context + memory\nWorkflow + stage run records\nChat sessions + product requests\nCLI reads from here to scope all commands",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
